
@startuml

title UniTrack - Conceptual Data Model

top to bottom direction

hide circle
hide members

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam class {
    BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
    BorderColor #475569
    FontColor #1E293B
}

entity "User\nENT-001" as USER

entity "Academic Period\nENT-002" as PERIOD

entity "Course\nENT-003" as COURSE

entity "Assessment\nENT-004" as ASSESSMENT

entity "Custom Academic Event\nENT-005" as EVENT

USER ||--o{ PERIOD : owns
PERIOD ||--o{ COURSE : contains
COURSE ||--o{ ASSESSMENT : contains
USER ||--o{ EVENT : owns

note right of PERIOD
    A user may have zero or
    one active academic period.
end note

note right of EVENT
    Custom events are independent
    of periods and courses.

    Assessment calendar entries
    are derived from assessments.
end note

note right of ASSESSMENT
    Total registered course weight
    must not exceed 100%.

    Grades are optional and must
    respect the course grading scale.
end note

legend bottom
    |= Notation |= Meaning |
    | ENT | Domain entity identifier |
    | Exactly one | Mandatory parent |
    | Zero or many | Optional collection |
endlegend

@enduml
